    <string name="app_name">Lockout Gate</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Watches which app is in the foreground so Lockout Gate can block time-wasting apps unless a break is active, and keeps the phone limited to calls and WhatsApp during a Keep Me Out focus lock. Also protects itself: reads on-screen text only within Settings and the Package Installer, to detect and bounce out of attempts to disable this service or uninstall this app from the phone (use a PC with ADB instead).</string>

